      "updated": 1725422858593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "1. The client application and the server application must be able to operate independently of each other. \n2. Each request from the client to the server must contain all the information needed to understand and process the request. \n3. Responses should be defined as cacheable or non-cacheable.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The client application and the server application must be able to operate independently of each other. \n2. Each request from the client to the server must contain all the information needed to understand and process the request. \n3. Responses should be defined as cacheable or non-cacheable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
