      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "GraphQL’s central feature is its ability to request and receive only the specific data requested — nothing more. \nThis makes it much simpler to scale your APIs along with your app.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GraphQL’s central feature is its ability to request and receive only the specific data requested — nothing more. \nThis makes it much simpler to scale your APIs along with your app.",
