      "fontSize": 62.27840317464227,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Code splitting consists of separating the code into several packages or components that can be loaded on demand or in parallel. \nThis means that they are not loaded until they are needed.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Code splitting consists of separating the code into several packages or components that can be loaded on demand or in parallel. \nThis means that they are not loaded until they are needed.",
