      "fontSize": 45.71428571428583,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "- Fetch and cache resources that may be requested some time soon but not immediately on the initial load. \n- A prefetched resource is fetched when the browser is idle and has calculated that it's got enough bandwidth, \nafter which it caches the prefetched resource. ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Fetch and cache resources that may be requested some time soon but not immediately on the initial load. \n- A prefetched resource is fetched when the browser is idle and has calculated that it's got enough bandwidth, \nafter which it caches the prefetched resource. ",
