      "fontSize": 47.20000000000003,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "- This is the idea of rendering only visible rows of content in a dynamic list instead of the entire list. \n- The rows rendered are only a small subset of the full list with what is visible (the window) moving as the user scrolls. \n- This can improve rendering performance.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- This is the idea of rendering only visible rows of content in a dynamic list instead of the entire list. \n- The rows rendered are only a small subset of the full list with what is visible (the window) moving as the user scrolls. \n- This can improve rendering performance.",
