      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 39.99999999999989,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": " - Web Vitals is an initiative by Google to provide unified guidance for quality signals \nthat are essential to delivering a great user experience on the web.\n- Core Web Vitals are the subset of Web Vitals that apply to all web pages, should be measured by all site owners, \nand will be surfaced across all Google tools.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - Web Vitals is an initiative by Google to provide unified guidance for quality signals \nthat are essential to delivering a great user experience on the web.\n- Core Web Vitals are the subset of Web Vitals that apply to all web pages, should be measured by all site owners, \nand will be surfaced across all Google tools.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
