      "updated": 1728093343351,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 46.66666666666641,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "- LCP reports the render time of the largest image, text block, or video visible in the viewport, \nrelative to when the user first navigated to the page.\n- <img> elements (the first frame presentation time is used for animated content such as GIFs or animated PNGs)\n- <image> elements inside an <svg> element\n- <video> elements (the poster image load time or first frame presentation time for videos is used—whichever is earlier)\n - An element with a background image loaded using the url() function, (as opposed to a CSS gradient)\n- Block-level elements containing text nodes or other inline-level text element children.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- LCP reports the render time of the largest image, text block, or video visible in the viewport, \nrelative to when the user first navigated to the page.\n- <img> elements (the first frame presentation time is used for animated content such as GIFs or animated PNGs)\n- <image> elements inside an <svg> element\n- <video> elements (the poster image load time or first frame presentation time for videos is used—whichever is earlier)\n - An element with a background image loaded using the url() function, (as opposed to a CSS gradient)\n- Block-level elements containing text nodes or other inline-level text element children.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
